OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWater main repairs to last for six
OL,4,Amore days
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepairs to a burst water main which
OL,7,Fcaused up 15,000 properties to lose
OL,8,Fwater or have low pressure are expected
OL,9,Fto last for six more days, Thames Water
OL,10,Fhas announced.
OL,12,FThe water main burst on 28 September,
OL,13,Faffecting people in areas of Surrey
OL,14,Fincluding Thames Ditton, Esher, and
OL,15,FSunbury, as well as south-west London.
OL,17,FThe water company said in its latest
OL,18,Fstatement that the affected section of
OL,19,Fthe main had been uncovered, so the
OL,20,Fteam was removing the damaged pipe and
OL,21,Fpreparing the area for its replacement.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
